# .dockerignore for Dockerfile.space (ts-space image)
#
# The build context is the repo root; the image needs exactly four things
# COPY'd out of it:
#   package.json / pnpm-lock.yaml / .npmrc / pnpm-workspace.yaml → builder install
#   out/               → prebuilt main+renderer+server bundles. These are built
#                        BEFORE `docker build` runs (scripts/build-space-image.sh)
#                        and COPY'd from context — so out/ must NOT be ignored.
#   src/server/shim.js → read at RUNTIME from resolve('src/server/shim.js')
#                        relative to CWD (SHIM_PATH in src/server/index.ts).
#                        It is not bundled into out/, so the path must survive
#                        into the image as source.
#
# Everything else is excluded, and for real reasons (not tidiness):
#   node_modules/ — the host copy is electron-rebuilt (Electron ABI); node-pty
#     would fail under plain node with a NODE_MODULE_VERSION mismatch. The
#     builder stage installs its own prod node_modules.
#   src/ — all of TypeScript source; only shim.js is re-included (dockerignore
#     cannot re-include a child of an excluded DIRECTORY, hence the
#     src/* → !src/server → src/server/* → !src/server/shim.js dance).
#   dist/ release/ build/ — electron-builder artifacts/icon, not used in the image.
#   relay/ — a separate package (own package.json + pnpm-lock.yaml), never part
#     of the app image; copying it would break the single-importer lockfile
#     assumption too.
#   .git/, .hermes/, .worktrees/, docs/, scripts/, tests — big and/or irrelevant.
# A tiny context also keeps `docker build` fast (no 28 MB out/ duplicates, no
# node_modules upload).

node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# electron-builder outputs + packaging assets (icon is only for the desktop app)
dist/
release/
build/*

# TS source: excluded wholesale, then shim.js is re-included through its chain
src/*
!src/server
src/server/*
!src/server/shim.js

# separate relay package (own lockfile) — not part of the app image
relay/

# repo docs/tooling/tests/plan junk
docs/
scripts/
.hermes/
.worktrees/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.log
.env
.env.*
README.md
AGENTS.md
